User accounts enable you to provide access to Tenable Vulnerability Management and manage
permissions for Tenable Vulnerability Management resources. You can use the API to perform
standard CRUD operations on user objects, and also change passwords, generate API keys,
impersonate users, enable multi-factor authentication, and manage access authorizations.
For background information about managing users, see Users in the Tenable Vulnerability
Management User Guide.
